Secure License Storage with Kubernetes Secrets & Pod Volume Mounting
Objective
The Nautilus DevOps team needed to securely store a license/password file (media.txt) located on the jump-host into a Kubernetes Cluster using a Secret, and consume it inside a running Pod (secret-xfusion) mounted at /opt/games.

